{"asset_key":"ep2/herohub_story_12411330","episode":"ep2","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"12411330","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1241133001:1":{"text":"해미, 그레이브본을 쫓아낼 수 있는 포션을 만들어줄 수 없어? 검에 바르고 싶어!","source_cn":"漫漫，你能不能帮我研制一些可以驱逐亡灵的魔法药水？我想...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C9029FF2E843AD8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1241133002:1":{"text":"검에 바른다고...? 하지만 네 검은 이미 충분히 날카롭잖아.","source_cn":"涂在剑上……？可你的剑已经足够锋利了呀。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E40D61695C6EF89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1241133003:1":{"text":"하지만 그레이브본을 상대하려면 검 한 자루로는 안 돼! 더 효과적인 방법이 없는지 알아봐야겠어.","source_cn":"但对付亡灵不能只靠一把剑！我看看有没有更有效的方法。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BB824CC950FC2DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1241133004:1":{"text":"좋은 방법을 찾으면 앞으로 그레이브본을 상대하기 훨씬 수월할 거야!","source_cn":"如果能找到有用的办法，以后面对亡灵敌人就事半功倍了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DA568039B16E9F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}